  "description": "Protect your 2020-2025 Kia Telluride’s interior with OEDRO floor liners designed specifically for models with 2nd-row bucket seats and no center console. Crafted from durable, high-quality TPE material, these floor mats provide exceptional protection against dirt, spills, and wear. The easy-to-clean surface ensures effortless maintenance, while the mats’ non-shedding design prevents accumulation of debris. You won’t have to worry about stains or build-up, keeping your car looking pristine. With a custom fit that stays securely in place, OEDRO floor liners deliver reliable, long-lasting protection for your vehicle’s flooring.\nFeatures\nDurability: OEDRO floor mats are made from high-quality, strong rubber, providing superior longevity compared to other mats. Their flexible design and heavy-duty material ensure they can withstand constant friction from shoes, maintaining their shape and functionality for years.\nSleek & Stylish Design: Add an extra touch of color and sophistication to your car's interior with OEDRO all-weather floor liners. Their unique design elevates the overall look of your vehicle, making it stand out with a modern and stylish appearance.\nComprehensive Protection: Offering unmatched protection, OEDRO floor mats are designed to shield your car’s carpet from dirt, spills, and debris. Your car’s interior will stay clean, dry, and well-maintained, no matter what the road brings.\nEffortless Cleaning: Cleaning OEDRO mats is a breeze! Simply wash off any spills, dirt, or debris with soap and water. Their easy-to-clean surface ensures no lingering odors, so your car will always smell fresh after drying.\nEffective Dirt & Moisture Trapping: Featuring a waterproof surface, these all-weather mats trap spills, dirt, sand, and dust efficiently. Whether you’re dealing with wet weather or dry messes, OEDRO floor mats provide reliable protection, keeping your vehicle’s interior pristine.\n2-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2020-2025 Kia Telluride\nWith 2nd Bucket Seats\nWithout Center Console",
